From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Omer Dangoor <omerdn1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 19:32:34 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Remove the update check

At startup the CLI asked api.copilot.mobile.dev for the latest version,
whatever MAESTRO_DISABLE_UPDATE_CHECK said: the variable only hid the
notice. The changelog fetch from raw.githubusercontent.com went with it.
Both are gone, along with ApiClient.getLatestCliVersion and
ChangeLogUtils.fetchContent.
